cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use fastokens in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "fastokens: A Fast BPE Tokenizer for Open-Weight LLMs"
abstract: >-
  fastokens is a fast byte-pair encoding (BPE) tokenizer for popular
  open-weight large language models, built on a high-performance Rust
  backend with Python bindings. It loads both the Hugging Face
  tokenizer.json format and tiktoken model files, can be used as a drop-in
  replacement for the tokenizers backend in transformers, and on average
  tokenizes more than 10x faster than the tokenizers library, reducing
  time-to-first-token in LLM serving workloads.
